%I A401255 #10 Oct 20 2026 23:57:55
%S A401255 1,9,85,1099,15464,234420,3691066,59920625,994641395
%N A401255 Number of free polyforms with n cells in the honeycomb of the 15-faced Voronoi cell of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3 (No. 201, origin choice 1).
%C A401255 The cell is a 15-faced space-filling polyhedron (3^6 4^3 5^2 6^2 7^2 faces) arising as the Voronoi cell of the orbit of the point (1/8, 1/6, 5/12) under space group Pn-3 (No. 201, origin choice 1); its honeycomb has 24 cell types (translation classes), each cell with 15 face-neighbors. Polyforms are face-connected clusters of cells, counted up to the full point-symmetry group of the honeycomb (translations, rotations and improper maps).
%C A401255 The symmetry group G of the tiling has order 24 modulo lattice translations (12 proper), and the counts satisfy the Burnside identity |G|*free(n) = Sum_g Fix_g(n).
%H A401255 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron: A space-filling plesiohedron based on the Fischer-Koch S Triply Periodic Minimal Surface</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026.
%H A401255 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22502081">plesiohedron-census: certified space-filling polyhedra from a gated agentic search (code, certificates, catalog)</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%H A401255 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_space_groups">List of space groups</a>.
%o A401255 (C++) // See A400460.
%Y A401255 Cf. A398957, A398958, A398959 (Josehedron polyforms, same enumerator); A385028, A397707-A397709 (polyforms on other space-filler honeycombs).
%Y A401255 Cf. A400460 (fixed), A400461 (one-sided).
